---
description: >
  Author, edit, preview or record Cinegram .dgm files — animated, narrated
  Mermaid diagrams. Apply when the user wants to animate a Mermaid diagram
  (flowchart or sequenceDiagram), add an animated walkthrough to a diagram,
  or work with a .dgm file.
globs: ["**/*.dgm"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the Cinegram authoring skill at `.cursor/skills/cinegram/SKILL.md`:
read it in full, then read `.cursor/skills/cinegram/references/language.md`
before writing any `.dgm` content. Key rules: never modify the user's Mermaid
source (animation blocks are appended after it), and always run
`cinegram lint <file> --format=json` and fix every diagnostic before showing
the result.
